Reol れをる (@RRReol) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RRReol/status/1220358143172956160?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 23, 2020</a></blockquote>"},{"discographyPostUuid":"019e8283-acab-735f-9e2e-59a43395971c","discographyPostId":"1220815453922004992","discographyPostHTML":"<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">BLOG更新 &quot;金字塔&quot;  <a href=\"https://t.co/TgaB4eHPOo\">https://t.co/TgaB4eHPOo</a></p>&mdash; Reol れをる (@RRReol) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RRReol/status/1220815453922004992?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 24, 2020</a></blockquote>"},{"discographyPostUuid":"019e8283-ad06-7f1c-b1a7-748ff4f7a3c9","discographyPostId":"1221000070226534400","discographyPostHTML":"<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">Twitter Japan に れをる見参 @TwitterJP <a href=\"https://t.co/XcSYSqbP2n\">pic.twitter.com/XcSYSqbP2n</a></p>&mdash; Reol れをる (@RRReol) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RRReol/status/1221000070226534400?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 25, 2020</a></blockquote>"},{"discographyPostUuid":"019e8283-ad64-740a-ae94-58c9c705beeb","discographyPostId":"1221028038713888768","discographyPostHTML":"<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">金字塔Q&amp;A from @TwitterJP <a href=\"https://t.co/u8VkKnEoKx\">pic.twitter.com/u8VkKnEoKx</a></p>&mdash; Reol れをる (@RRReol) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RRReol/status/1221028038713888768?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 25, 2020</a></blockquote>"},{"discographyPostUuid":"019e8283-adc1-75c9-a550-027c146c2ee5","discographyPostId":"1221038648864296960","discographyPostHTML":"<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">Q: Is the new album&quot;Kinjitou&quot;a sequel of the album&quot;Jijitsujo&quot;that you released last year? Are the two works related in terms of storyline?<br><br>今回のアルバム&quot;金字塔&quot;は去年リリースしたアルバム&quot;事実上&quot;の続編ですか？ストーリー的には繋がっていますか？ <a href=\"https://t.co/fIFk7LguRz\">pic.twitter.com/fIFk7LguRz</a></p>&mdash; Reol れをる (@RRReol) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RRReol/status/1221038648864296960?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 25, 2020</a></blockquote>"},{"discographyPostUuid":"019e8283-ae30-7b08-9daa-86b39a4f5a01","discographyPostId":"1221039822782885888","discographyPostHTML":"<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">Q: Your videos are always innovative and very entertaining. How much are you involved with creating/choosing the concept, choreography and costumes/fashion?<br><br>あなたのMVはいつも斬新で面白いです。MVのコンセプト、振り付け、衣装などはどれくらい関わっていますか？ <a href=\"https://t.co/vd2XvZvYZi\">pic.twitter.com/vd2XvZvYZi</a></p>&mdash; Reol れをる (@RRReol) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RRReol/status/1221039822782885888?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 25, 2020</a></blockquote>"},{"discographyPostUuid":"019e8283-ae8f-70b8-9049-3146ddcd3854","discographyPostId":"1221040658795786240","discographyPostHTML":"<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">Q: 美大生です。芸術artと美術fine artの英語をどう思いますか？私は同じアートで美術にfineが付くのが納得できません。<br><br>What is your opinion on the terms ‘art’, and ‘fine arts’?<br>I don’t understand why there’s a separate term such as ‘fine arts’. <a href=\"https://t.co/X84sXijNlx\">pic.twitter.com/X84sXijNlx</a></p>&mdash; Reol れをる (@RRReol) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RRReol/status/1221040658795786240?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 25, 2020</a></blockquote>"},{"discographyPostUuid":"019e8283-aef9-7a05-9a9f-040cf7cffcc3","discographyPostId":"1221041290294390784","discographyPostHTML":"<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">Q: you will do a world tour someday? What‘s your opinion about have fans overseas?<br><br>いつか世界ツアーはやりますか？海外のファンが沢山いることについてどう思いますか？ <a href=\"https://t.co/1HxT0hUl5q\">pic.twitter.com/1HxT0hUl5q</a></p>&mdash; Reol れをる (@RRReol) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RRReol/status/1221041290294390784?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 25, 2020</a></blockquote>"},{"discographyPostUuid":"019e8283-af66-7877-9ab6-4f55305d7b01","discographyPostId":"1221041971487076353","discographyPostHTML":"<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">Q: ライブの時の服は衣装ですか？それとも私服なんですか？また私服はどういうところで買っていますか？<br><br>Do you wear a costume on stage, or is it your own clothes? If they are your own clothes, where do you buy them? <a href=\"https://t.co/FwKYEmYrAU\">pic.twitter.com/FwKYEmYrAU</a></p>&mdash; Reol れをる (@RRReol) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RRReol/status/1221041971487076353?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 25, 2020</a></blockquote>"},{"discographyPostUuid":"019e8283-afda-7f5e-bd7a-433fb74ec343","discographyPostId":"1221042669293490176","discographyPostHTML":"<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">Q:本当につらくて悲しい時、れをるさんならどうしますか？<br><br>When times are tough and you feel really down, what do you do? <a href=\"https://t.co/O7313GKHfV\">pic.twitter.com/O7313GKHfV</a></p>&mdash; Reol れをる (@RRReol) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RRReol/status/1221042669293490176?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 25, 2020</a></blockquote>"},{"discographyPostUuid":"019e8283-b038-77fb-ad7d-47b315cafd0c","discographyPostId":"1221389473910423552","discographyPostHTML":"<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">Q:&quot;金字塔&quot;の曲順を決める際に意識したことはありますか？いつもこだわっているとお聞きしたのでとても気になります！！<br><br>Is there anything you considered when choosing the song order for&quot;Kinjitou&quot;? <a href=\"https://t.co/ed88vbzkpr\">pic.twitter.com/ed88vbzkpr</a></p>&mdash; Reol れをる (@RRReol) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RRReol/status/1221389473910423552?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 26, 2020</a></blockquote>"},{"discographyPostUuid":"019e8283-b0a8-7634-8ac5-bbca62aa6710","discographyPostId":"1221390270119337985","discographyPostHTML":"<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">Q: I love all the different instruments you in your songs(like shamisen, sitar, organ), do you have a favourite instrument sound?<br><br>あなたが楽曲で使っている楽器が大好きです(三味線、シタール、オルガンなど)、一番好きな楽器の音は何ですか？ <a href=\"https://t.co/esRN0NbvC3\">pic.twitter.com/esRN0NbvC3</a></p>&mdash; Reol れ